1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:14,110
What was the polite request?
那个彬彬有礼的要求是什么？

2
00:00:14,110 --> 00:00:16,680
What was the polite request?
那个彬彬有礼的要求是什么？

3
00:00:19,290 --> 00:00:22,820
If you park your car in the wrong place,
一旦你把汽车停错了地方，

4
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:26,550
a traffic policeman will soon find it.
交通警很快就会发现的。

5
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:30,270
You will be very lucky
你会非常走运的，

6
00:00:30,290 --> 00:00:32,930
if he lets you go without a ticket.
如果他没给你开罚单就让你走了。

7
00:00:34,490 --> 00:00:38,160
However, this does not always happen.
然而，情况并不都是这样。

8
00:00:39,510 --> 00:00:43,120
Traffic police are sometimes very polite.
交通警有时也很客气。

9
00:00:44,870 --> 00:00:47,060
During a holiday in Sweden,
有一次在瑞典度假，

10
00:00:47,980 --> 00:00:50,570
I found this note on my car:
我发现我的车上有这样一个字条：

11
00:00:54,530 --> 00:00:57,440
'sir, we welcome you to our city.
“先生，欢迎您光临我们的城市。

12
00:00:58,400 --> 00:01:01,350
This is a No Parking area.
此处是‘禁止停车’区。

13
00:01:02,530 --> 00:01:05,180
You will enjoy your stay here
如果您对我们街上的标牌稍加注意，

14
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:08,140
if you pay attention to our street signs.
您在此会过得很愉快的。

15
00:01:09,660 --> 00:01:12,330
This note is only a reminder.'
谨此提请注意。”

16
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:17,150
If you receive a request like this,
如果你收到这样的恳求，

17
00:01:17,220 --> 00:01:19,970
you cannot fail to obey it!
你是不会不遵照执行的！
